WEBVTT

00:04:25.469 --> 00:04:30.099
And that often breeds out the nutrition.

00:04:31.309 --> 00:04:35.813
Let's take, for example,
Purslane or Verdolagas,

00:04:35.855 --> 00:04:38.774
if you are in a Spanish-speaking
part of the Americas.

00:04:39.275 --> 00:04:44.405
It is a weed that grows out
of sidewalk cracks in the summertime.

00:04:45.614 --> 00:04:49.493
It is chock-full of Omega-3s,
and it ain’t a fish.

00:04:50.411 --> 00:04:52.872
Iron, get out of here, Popeye.

00:04:52.913 --> 00:04:53.914
(Laughter)

00:04:53.914 --> 00:04:55.207
And vitamin C,

00:04:55.249 --> 00:04:57.501
your immune system will thank you.

00:04:58.377 --> 00:05:01.547
Sometimes I will just stand
in my neighborhood,